# ApprovedRuleHasScope: SemQL validation on GovernanceRule of the GovernanceRules accelerator. An approved rule has at least one scope row.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.validations
_type: SemQLValidation
_name: ApprovedRuleHasScope
entity: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.GovernanceRule
label: Approved rule has a scope
description: An approved rule has at least one scope row. A rule with no scope row is never returned by ApplicableRules, so it would be invisible to design agents.
validationScope: PRE_CONSO
validationLabel: An approved rule needs at least one scope (data domain, classification or attribute type; leave all three empty to apply everywhere).
condition: LifecycleStatus <> 'APPROVED' OR any Scopes have (1 = 1)
